              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Ahasia nee Yoram garmoó Ahabu tari tláy tawa slaqwarár ay nee Hasaeli waawutmoó Aramu amór Ramot-gileadi, didár múk Aramu waawutmo Yoram nguwa hariayé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
