          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Yoram iri kií/ baraá gixsár Yesre'eli as kuwa maasáy haniisi daanduú slahh'amuú aa slayi amór Ramár wa ale, qoomár tawa slaqwi nee Hasaeli waawutmoó Aramu. Ahasia garmoó Yehoramu waawutmoó Yuda, Yoram garmoó Ahabu kuduú baraá Yesre'eli guri neetleesi áy asma inós i tiiq.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.29"
            ]
          }
